8
00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:23.580
So in order to make our Background

9
00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:25.740
transition seamlessly back and forth,

10
00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:30.311
we're going to use some new
variables to be able to do so.

11
00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:33.210
But first what we want to do is
we're actually going to use

