00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:35.740
one of our Box Colliders to help us,

13
00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:38.320
with this problem.

14
00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:41.258
So on our Background,
we're going to add a Component,

15
00:00:42.198 --> 00:00:44.639
and then we're going to look
for a Box Collider.

16
00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:50.230
And now you see
that our Box Collider wraps

17
00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:53.856
entirely around our Background
which is perfect

18
00:00:54.350 --> 00:00:56.450
because once again,
that means that there's less

19
00:00:56.450 --> 00:00:59.317
that I have to do myself
