00:01:37.750 --> 00:01:39.638
when we want to reset
our position.

33
00:01:40.550 --> 00:01:42.550
In our Start() method,

34
00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:45.710
we're actually going 
to set our repeatWidth

35
00:01:45.710 --> 00:01:47.610
so we'll use repeatWidth,

36
00:01:52.670 --> 00:01:58.240
and we're going to set this to the size
