00:02:01.460 --> 00:02:04.203
we're actually going to need
that "GetComponent<>()" method again.

39
00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:06.400
So we're going to GetComponent<>(),

40
00:02:09.880 --> 00:02:12.150
and now we need
that left and right carat

41
00:02:13.720 --> 00:02:16.871
so that we can get the type
of Component we're looking for.

42
00:02:17.410 --> 00:02:19.900
So in this case, we're
looking for a BoxCollider,

